-- annex E 1(ב) ¶15-¶31, 1(ג): the teacher's example (a mother teaching in
-- junior high, position factor 0.9, Y = 34), checked above.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p15 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p16 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p17 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p18 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p19 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p20 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p21 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p22 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p23 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p24 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p25 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p26 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p27 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p28 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p29 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p30 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p31 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c/p2
`the teacher's coefficient in the example` MEANS 34

-- annex E 1(ד): placement in the table at the grade whose salary is the
-- nearest at or above A. The example's grade-6 salary ₪9,670.70 is that row.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p3 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p4
GIVEN `table salaries` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc the salaries of the grades at the employee's seniority, in the table
      `converted` IS A NUMBER @desc the salary after conversion (A)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the placement salary` `table salaries` `converted` IS
    minimum (filter (GIVEN s YIELD s AT LEAST `converted`) `table salaries`)

#ASSERT 9670.70 AT LEAST `the teacher's stated A`

-- akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p5 The heading "דגשים".

-- annex E 1(ד)2, 2(ג) ¶3, 3(ג) ¶3: on unpaid leave, sabbatical or another
-- unpaid absence in the year before joining, the conversion salary is
-- September's of the year of joining.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_2__subpara_c/p3 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p3
GIVEN `absent without pay before joining` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the conversion month` `absent without pay before joining` IS
    IF `absent without pay before joining` THEN "September of the year of joining" ELSE "March of the year before joining"

