-- annex E 3: a principal — Y = 15%; the example (factor 1.5, complexity
-- 5): 16,314.81 / 1.5 + 6,230.46 = 17,107; × 1.034 = 17,688.638; A =
-- 20,341.933; placed at 20,359.87, grade ג+. For the position beyond 100%
-- (to 150%) a personal supplement: B = T × (100 + Y)/100, T the full
-- salary at the whole position (March of the year before; for an absent
-- principal, March of the year before the absence); C = B − the new
-- tabular salary, turned into a percentage of the combined salary.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a/p3 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a/p4 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a/p5 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a/p6 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a/p7 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_b akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_b/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p4 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p5 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p6 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p7 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p8 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p9 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p10 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p11 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p12 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p13 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p14 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p15 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p16 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p17 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p18 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p19 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p20 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p21 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c/p22 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_d akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_d/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p3 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p4 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p5 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p6 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p7 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p8 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p9 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p10 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p11 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p12 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p13 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p14 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p15 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p16 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_1 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_3 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_4
GIVEN T IS A NUMBER, Y IS A NUMBER, `new tabular salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the principal's personal supplement rate` T Y `new tabular salary` IS
    (T TIMES (100 PLUS Y) DIVIDED BY 100 MINUS `new tabular salary`) DIVIDED BY `new tabular salary`

